OL,13,     Fcrossbow was tampered with and the
OL,14,     Fdeath wasn't an accident, the pair
OL,15,     Fhave a difficult task in solving
OL,16,     Fthe crime as all the performers
OL,17,     Fhave alibis for the time of the
OL,18,     Fmurder and the circus was closed
